ALBUKHR Ecosystem — Read-only Architecture Audit
Ranar bincike: 11 Oktoba 2026
Yanayi: Read-only source/database inspection. Ba a yi code change, SQL write/migration, Storage change, GitHub commit, ko deployment ba.
Manufar: Fahimtar ainihin User Side, Admin Side, Mainnet API, Testnet API, Supabase Mainnet/Testnet, da Mainnet → Testnet authentication handoff kafin a ci gaba da Pi dApp Launch Service.
1. Babban hukunci
Kada a aiwatar da sabon Pi dApp Launch Service har sai an warware muhimman batutuwan architecture da identity da ke ƙasa. ALBUKHR ya riga ya ware User Side, Admin Side, Mainnet API, Testnet API, da Supabase Mainnet/Testnet. Sabon service ya kamata ya bi waɗannan iyakoki; ba zai ƙirƙiri sabon authentication system ko ya saka service routes cikin Testnet ba sai an amince da wannan a fili.
Gyaran shawarar da aka bayar a baya
An dakatar da shawarar da ta gabata ta gina Client Test Workspace a cikin ALBUKHR Testnet a matsayin wani ɓangare na dApp Launch Service. Wannan shawarar ta yi ƙarin zato fiye da abin da aka tabbatar. Bisa bayanin mai tsarin, Pi dApp Launch Service zai kasance Mainnet service, yayin da ALBUKHR Testnet ke kiyaye nasa gateway/handoff. Gwajin dApp na abokin ciniki a Pi Sandbox/Testnet ba daidai yake da ƙirƙirar sabon dApp-service workflow a ALBUKHR Testnet ba.
Candidate v3 da aka yi a baya ba a aiwatar da shi a GitHub ko Supabase ba bisa binciken da ake da shi. Kada a ɗauke shi a matsayin implementation da aka amince da shi.
