3.3 RLS / Storage caveat
A Mainnet, albukhr_security.external_project_document_upload_tokens shi ne table ɗaya da RLS ba ya kunna a yanzu. Binciken privilege ya nuna anon da authenticated ba su da direct SELECT/INSERT privileges a wannan table, saboda haka wannan binciken bai tabbatar da data leak ba. Duk da haka, wannan ya kamata a sake dubawa a security review saboda table ɗin yana ɗauke da upload-token state kuma schema ɗin na cikin API surface na aikin.
4. Ainihin Mainnet → Testnet User authentication flow
Wannan flow ya fito daga source code da Edge Functions da aka karanta:
Mai amfani ya fara daga Testnet Login (test.albukhr.com). js/login.js na Testnet ba ya authenticate Pi kai tsaye; yana tura mai amfani zuwa https://app.albukhr.com/login.html?returnTo=testnet.
Mainnet login.js yana kiran window.AlbukhrPiAuth.ensurePiAuth(). Mainnet Pi Auth Core yana initialize Pi SDK tare da sandbox:false; access token yana cikin memory, ba a adana shi a LocalStorage/sessionStorage.
js/mainnet-testnet-handoff.js yana aika token ɗin zuwa Mainnet Supabase Edge Function testnet-auth-issuer kawai. Wannan function ɗin yana tabbatar da token ta https://api.minepi.com/v2/me.
Mainnet issuer yana ƙirƙirar HMAC-signed assertion mai iss=albukhr-mainnet, aud=test.albukhr.com, network=testnet, Pi UID, username, iat, exp (minti 2) da nonce. Ba a aika Pi access token ɗin zuwa Testnet.
Assertion ɗin ya tafi zuwa Testnet Edge Function testnet-auth-gateway. Testnet gateway yana tabbatar da signature, issuer, audience, network, lokaci da nonce; nonce hash yana hana replay. Yana ƙirƙirar one-time access code, hash ɗinsa kaɗai ake adanawa, kuma code yana ƙarewa cikin kusan daƙiƙa 60.
Mai amfani ya koma test.albukhr.com da access_code. Testnet gateway auth module yana redeem code ɗin ta hanyar conditional update (used_at IS NULL) don hana amfani sau biyu. Gateway ya samar da Testnet session mai expiry na minti 30 da network='testnet'.
Browser yana ajiye Testnet session ɗin wucin gadi a sessionStorage (ba Pi access token ba). test-albukhr-api yana hash token ɗin ya bincika testnet_sessions, kuma yana duba network='testnet', expiry da revocation.
Wannan tsarin handoff ne da ya kamata a kiyaye; kada a maye gurbinsa da browser-side network parameter, wani token na daban, ko sabon login.
Policy question da ba a warware ba
Mainnet issuer yana tabbatar da cewa Pi access token ingantacce ne ta Pi API, amma code ɗin da aka karanta bai duba public.users/successful record_pi_login ko wani per-user Testnet grant kafin ya ba da Testnet access code. Don haka, UI yana tilasta wucewa ta Mainnet login, amma issuer ɗin server-side yana tabbatar da Pi identity ne—ba a tabbatar da cewa an gama duk Mainnet ALBUKHR account workflow ba. Dole a fayyace ko manufar ita ce duk mai ingantaccen Mainnet Pi token ya iya shiga Testnet, ko sai ya zama Mainnet ALBUKHR user da aka tabbatar. Kada a ɗauka ba tare da shawarar mai tsarin ba.
5. Ainihin Admin → Testnet access da project-registry mirror
Admin Auth na albukhr-admin Mainnet-only ne. get_my_admin_context() yana gina context daga admin_users, role assignments, MFA/AAL2 da testnet_access_grants.
Mainnet Edge Function testnet-admin-issuer yana tabbatar da Supabase Admin access token, admin status active, mfa_verified=true, da testnet_access=true kafin ya ƙirƙiri assertion na Testnet Admin.
A yayin wannan flow, Mainnet issuer yana karanta approved/active Mainnet project registry tare da logo metadata, sannan ya aika da metadata zuwa Testnet gateway.
Testnet testnet-admin-gateway yana duba signature/issuer/audience/network/expiry/nonce; yana samar da one-time Admin code/session. Registry mirror yana sauya network na project metadata da aka amince da shi kaɗai zuwa testnet kuma yana sanya registration_source='mainnet-approved-mirror'.
Wannan shi ne one-way mirror na approved project registry da aka nuna a source code; ba hujja ba ce ta cewa ana sync users, investments, stakes, payments ko Mainnet transaction records zuwa Testnet. Dole ne a kiyaye wannan bambanci a duk wani sabon code.
6. Babban security finding — Mainnet record_pi_login
Matsayi: BLOCKER don dogaro da wannan RPC a matsayin tabbatacciyar ALBUKHR identity authority, har sai an sake duba shi. Babu canji da aka yi.
Binciken live schema ya nuna:
public.record_pi_login(p_pi_uid, p_username, p_wallet_address, p_network, p_status) yana SECURITY DEFINER.
anon da authenticated duka suna da EXECUTE permission.
Function ɗin yana karɓar pi_uid da network daga input, kuma yana yarda da network IN ('mainnet','testnet').
A success branch yana INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (pi_uid) DO UPDATE, kuma network = EXCLUDED.network yana iya sabunta network na user.
Function signature ɗin ba ya karɓar Pi access token kuma ba ya kiran Pi Platform API don tabbatar da pi_uid.
A lokacin binciken, babu testnet users ko login events a Mainnet DB; records da aka ƙidaya duk Mainnet ne. Saboda haka wannan contract risk ne, ba rahoton cewa an riga an sami haɗuwar bayanai ba.
Tasirin da zai iya tasowa: API caller mai publishable key zai iya kiran RPC da pi_uid da network da ya zaɓa. Wannan bai dace da manufar cewa Testnet records su kasance a Testnet DB kaɗai ba; kuma backend ba zai iya ɗaukar wannan RPC kaɗai a matsayin tabbacin Pi identity ba. Ya kamata a tsara gyara mai iyaka: Mainnet-only network enforcement a Mainnet DB, da kuma tabbatar da Pi identity/server authorization kafin a create/update user record. Sai a shirya SQL migration da rollback/verification plan; kada a yi amfani da SQL write kai tsaye a wannan audit.
Bambanci: Testnet copy na public.record_pi_login an kulle shi zuwa network='testnet', kuma ACL da aka karanta yana ba service_role kawai izinin execute—anon da authenticated ba su da izini. Wannan bambanci ya kamata a kiyaye.
