8. Pi dApp Launch Service: iyakar da ya kamata a yi amfani da ita
Bisa bayanan da aka tabbatar zuwa yanzu:
Service workflow: a ƙera shi ne domin Mainnet User Side + Mainnet API + Mainnet Admin Side + Mainnet Supabase, tare da auth mai bin canonical Mainnet Pi Auth Core.
ALBUKHR Testnet: kada a ɗora masa dApp Launch Service request/quote/payment state a matsayin default. Ya ci gaba da kasancewa environment ɗin Testnet na ALBUKHR da ke amfani da Mainnet-issued handoff.
Client dApp sandbox testing: a bambanta shi da ALBUKHR Testnet. Za a tsara yadda abokin ciniki zai gwada nasa dApp ta Pi Sandbox/Testnet bisa Pi Developer Platform requirements, ba ta hanyar kwafe Mainnet request/payment data zuwa ALBUKHR Testnet ba.
Payment: request status, quote status, payment status da delivery status su kasance daban; receipt ko browser callback kaɗai ba hujjar settlement ba ce. Kada a kunna real Pi/bank payment har sai an tabbatar da contracts da end-to-end tests.
Admin: a yi amfani da canonical Mainnet Admin Auth/MFA/roles; kada a ƙirƙiri Admin login na biyu ko a haɗa dApp workflow cikin External Projects Admin module ba tare da iyakar permissions ba.
Change policy: babu deployment, SQL migration, Storage write ko GitHub commit kafin a amince da gap report da design.
9. Abin da wannan audit bai tabbatar ba
Ba a yi browser end-to-end test na app.albukhr.com, test.albukhr.com ko admin.albukhr.com ba.
Ba a tabbatar cewa abin da ke live hosting da abin da ke cikin main branch sun yi daidai ba.
Ba a yi runtime test na Pi /v2/me, HMAC handoff, access-code redemption, Pi payment, bank reconciliation ko payout ba.
Ba a karanta dukkan kowane file a repos ɗin ba. Wannan audit ɗin ya karanta canonical authentication/environment/gateway entrypoints, API entrypoints, Supabase schema inventory, migration metadata, RLS summaries, Storage metadata da relevant RPC/Edge Function source. Mataki na gaba kafin coding shi ne targeted review na dApp pages, API route contracts da Admin integration files.
Binciken SQL duk read-only ne; babu mutation da aka gudanar.
10. Shawarar mataki na gaba
Kar a gina sabon service yanzu. Da farko a tsara mini-migration/review plan na record_pi_login da network isolation, tare da SQL verification queries kafin da bayan, ba tare da aiwatarwa ba.
A tabbatar da deployment mapping na albukhr-app, dev-albukhr-app, test-albukhr-app da domains ɗinsu.
A yi dApp-specific source audit: shafukan pi-dapp-service.html, my-dapp-requests.html, scripts ɗin da suke nuni da su, Mainnet server.js, Admin routes/pages, da payment verification contracts.
Bayan waɗannan, a gabatar da Architecture v2 mai Mainnet-only dApp service kuma a sa Mainnet → Testnet auth handoff a matsayin existing dependency, ba sabon tsarin da za a sake gina shi ba.
Kammalawa: Babban tushe na ALBUKHR ya riga ya nuna rarrabuwar muhalli da kuma Mainnet-issued Testnet handoff. Amma kafin dApp service ya yi amfani da wannan tushe, akwai babban rashin daidaito a Mainnet record_pi_login wanda ya kamata a warware da takamaiman migration mai iyaka. Babu wani canji da aka yi a wannan audit.
